          "from": "Proto-Turkic *ïgač 'tree'",
          "to": "ağac 'tree' (c = [dʒ])",
          "note": "Word-final *č voiced in Azerbaijani, while Turkmen agaç, Uzbek yogʻoch and Kazakh ағаш keep a voiceless reflex."
